[[File:Scytodes thoracica - side 2 (aka).jpg|thumb|a '''spitting spider''', {{taxlink|Scytodes thoracica|species}}]]

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# Any spider from the family {{taxlink|Scytodidae|family|noshow=1}}. These spiders catch their prey by spitting an immobilizing fluid at them.

